| **Idle Minutes**               | 0                                |
| **Pod Deadline (seconds)**     | 0                                |
| **Jenkins Connection Timeout** | 1000 (OK)                        |
| **Yaml merge strategy**        | Override                         |
| **Show raw yaml in console**   | Optional                         |

